<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\walk-snow2早い.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\タイヤの跡2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―I'd run only about 200 meters.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But running 200 meters up a slope that hard to walk, at my age, hit my body harder than I'd imagined.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\タイヤの跡2朦朧.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It wasn't enough to make me collapse, but my mind grew a little hazy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My vision blurred a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put my hands on my knees and caught my breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would probably pass if I rested a little, though.<PG>
And then―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\装甲車朦朧.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before my eyes spread a scene that proved where the gunshots had come from.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My vision was still blurry, but this had to be the place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The shooting had happened right around here, no doubt about it.<PG>
All the while, my eyes were clearly taking in what lay before me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hazy as my mind was, I could perceive what the scene meant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only, though I could perceive it and recognize it, I could not understand it.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
That was how hard the scene was to comprehend.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラーインダストリアル.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\装甲車.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The cherry blossoms piled on the ground were stained with fresh blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The spattered blood gathered and flowed as a red river across the pink earth.<PG>
10 people... no, maybe about 15.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People in gear like spacesuits lay collapsed on the piled cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But had the protective suits been of no use?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They didn't move a muscle, lying face down on the carpet of cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The protective suits had meant nothing against this air.<PG>
No, that was wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If blood was flowing, then these protective suits had been torn open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And lying beside them were firearms, machine guns or automatic rifles, I couldn't tell which.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words... 
{PAUSE ""}
in other words...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They had fought someone and been killed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A familiar voice, right behind me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But a voice with all the strength drained out of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice with no spirit, no energy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32血まみれ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was covered in blood all over, standing there <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dazed</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this blood <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> own, or spatter from them?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're not... hurt...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> wasn't hurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then it was their blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> must have seen what happened here.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What happened...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32血まみれバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The things I don't want to say... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't have to say them, right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So it was... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want to die..."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\心臓取り出す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESOFF "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ心臓.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\心臓.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "580" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> body swayed, and then came a low sound, like someone hitting a broken drum.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right after that, from <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> body, a slithering sound of liquid rubbing against liquid.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Liquid can't rub against liquid, but if I had to describe it, it was the sound of liquid rubbing against liquid.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And with that sound―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-256\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n324\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-256\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n324\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> chest, a hand clutching a twitching organ.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"I don't... want to... die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n960\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n960\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>When the hand holding the organ went back into <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> body, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> collapsed to the ground just like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And behind her―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\装甲車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花心臓持つ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\パラサイト\パラサイト普通.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I know it's bad. But if I do this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who said it, drenched in as much blood as <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, was <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The heart gripped in <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its pulse grew weaker and weaker.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was dying...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What is this? This... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what are you going to do to her...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">My mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The mom who raised me</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I told you she died, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Back then―"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\美冬車.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... where am I...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"Haah...! Haah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>I'd been put in a car, and beside me <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> was driving, clutching her chest in pain.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Wait, what is this! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what're you doing!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"H-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Just a little more... just a little more...! We're almost there...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>At that point, I'd completely forgotten being carried off to the roof, and jumping off the roof.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I knew for sure was that <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> was suffering right in front of me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! I dunno what's going on, but we're going to the hospital, right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grabbed <STYLE ID="5">Mom's</STYLE> hand, yanked the parking brake, and forced the car to stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...! Just keep quiet...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Please, just stop! You're gonna die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When I threw my arms around <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> to stop her―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dressing.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\血のイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"Ngh... haah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>Mom</STYLE> even started vomiting blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\美冬吐血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"We're going... hurry, before I die...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>Overwhelmed by the desperate, fearsome look on her face, I couldn't do a thing anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> kept the car moving on willpower alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had no idea what was making <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> suffer like this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And somehow we made it all the way to Arata, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm sorry, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> breathed her last the moment she got me to Arata.<PG>
I found out later, but <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> had used Droga to jump off the roof and to slip past people and get away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd pulled moves that crazy while carrying me, so her body was screaming.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I... cried.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I still didn't know why <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> did this, or why she died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Dad</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>, the guys who bullied me in Megasawa, they all died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone who gets involved with me ends up unhappy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I really hated my own weakness.<PG>
I wanted to toughen myself up all over again, so I went into the mountain seclusion, the rite of passage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on April 8 of Shiyo 802, 2 years after the Motoki-cho case―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Stopping by the settlement for the first time in a while, I came into contact with the Goddess's 'Blessing.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The 'Blessing' had been released for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thanks to that 'Blessing,' I was able to become the Goddess's <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しんし">divine messenger</STYLE>.<PG>
