{MESON "500"}
The goddess, the 'Blessing,' divine messengers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Line up words that make no sense, and there's no way I can understand them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I do understand is that this <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> was nothing but a threat after all.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But... after all, I don't just need </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. I need </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> qualifies to become a divine messenger. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Because Arata and Motoki-cho got connected... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">that's why I came to get her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was probably talking about whatever caused this great disaster, but there hadn't been a scrap of anything like it in the information from <STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"All that's left is for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to become a divine messenger, and the Goddess's wish is fulfilled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Then it's me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, together for eternity."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> one-sided talk, and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> remains, had left me speechless, but now I finally came back to myself.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... us... what are you going to do with us...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Like I said, with this, me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> are together for eternity. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Of course, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">No―</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my real mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, because you qualify to be a divine messenger too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, I couldn't read <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> expression well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was she crying, or smiling?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't tell what she was thinking as she spoke to me now.<PG>
