{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> glanced over at the 15 or so in protective suits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"These guys would be trouble if the Goddess's secret got out, so I decided to have them return to the earth."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> do all of this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Against 15 people with guns?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... tell me, what happened...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
