{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm being kept alive. By the Goddess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What is this Goddess...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The Goddess brought </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my mom who died</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> back to life as a divine messenger. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And then me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, and you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That makes all four of us. The living and the dead of the first and second generations."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What... what are you saying...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you qualify to be a divine messenger too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'll ask the Goddess myself, so let's become one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Part of the Goddess―"</STYLE><PG>
